WEBVTT

01:18.610 --> 01:21.910
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.070 --> 01:24.700
[Episode 17]

01:27.000 --> 01:27.950
Are you okay?

01:28.039 --> 01:28.640
Wait.

01:28.640 --> 01:29.640
Go away.

01:30.480 --> 01:32.229
What did she mean by that just now?

01:32.229 --> 01:34.430
What happened to the company? Spun off?

01:37.920 --> 01:39.320
You haven't told her yet?

01:41.000 --> 01:42.229
You neither.

01:44.350 --> 01:45.200
Wait a minute.

01:45.509 --> 01:46.920
You both knew what happened

01:46.920 --> 01:47.979
but didn't tell me,

01:48.590 --> 01:49.280
right?

01:50.280 --> 01:50.950
Jingjing,

01:52.289 --> 01:52.950
well...

01:53.870 --> 01:56.200
Xinxin Vision was spun
off by Shan Li Fang.

01:58.190 --> 01:59.960
And the instigator of all this

02:00.710 --> 02:02.270
is your most trusted bestie

02:03.000 --> 02:04.660
and our good friend, Qian Fei.

02:07.750 --> 02:09.190
Fei, what's going on?

02:13.560 --> 02:14.830
Qian Fei, listen.

02:15.190 --> 02:16.650
Today, when Jingjing knew

02:16.870 --> 02:18.150
Wang Ruohai forced you
to pay him back,

02:18.150 --> 02:20.280
she took out her savings
without hesitation

02:20.280 --> 02:22.050
and stood up for you,
without caring about her image.

02:22.050 --> 02:23.110
But what about you?

02:23.840 --> 02:25.100
What did you do for her?

02:27.030 --> 02:28.430
Along with your project,

02:29.840 --> 02:32.430
you pushed her fiancé's company to death.

02:33.470 --> 02:34.960
Lu Ze, don't talk nonsense.

02:34.960 --> 02:37.200
Nonsense? Ask her yourself.

02:39.000 --> 02:39.520
Fei.

02:40.079 --> 02:41.079
I planned it.

02:42.560 --> 02:43.310
Why?

02:44.590 --> 02:45.600
I'm sorry.

02:48.079 --> 02:49.360
I need to talk to you.

02:49.910 --> 02:50.280
No,

02:50.280 --> 02:52.340
let me get this straight first, okay?

03:09.840 --> 03:11.360
Didn't you have something to say?

03:11.360 --> 03:11.960
Speak.

03:27.870 --> 03:29.840
You've been preoccupied lately.

03:32.310 --> 03:33.640
I thought

03:34.000 --> 03:37.730
you were busy with the company's joint
listing with headquarters.

03:40.079 --> 03:41.120
I am foolish.

03:44.590 --> 03:47.000
I'm the only one kept in the dark.

03:48.240 --> 03:49.560
Such a big incident happened,

03:49.560 --> 03:51.090
but I knew nothing about it.

03:56.430 --> 03:58.240
How could I know nothing?

04:00.000 --> 04:01.130
I dared not tell you.

04:02.960 --> 04:04.120
I thought

04:04.560 --> 04:06.130
Qian Fei would tell you.

04:08.920 --> 04:10.200
Then, you would angrily

04:10.200 --> 04:11.330
come to confront me.

04:15.060 --> 04:17.390
I've been fearfully waiting for this day.

04:20.000 --> 04:21.730
Are you writing a script for me,

04:22.310 --> 04:24.180
making me act along with you?

04:25.390 --> 04:26.270
You thought?

04:27.560 --> 04:28.700
Interesting.

04:36.680 --> 04:38.300
Simply put,

04:39.950 --> 04:42.550
Xinxin Vision has no
commercialized products

04:42.630 --> 04:44.000
and is deep in debt.

04:44.370 --> 04:45.560
Prior to the IPO, Shan Li Fang

04:45.560 --> 04:46.920
reviewed its accounts.

04:47.240 --> 04:49.170
To avoid affecting its valuation,

04:49.870 --> 04:51.950
they decided to drop us, a dead weight.

04:51.950 --> 04:53.810
So, they divested Xinxin Vision.

04:56.450 --> 04:56.970
Lately,

04:57.000 --> 04:58.190
I've been looking for new investments

04:58.190 --> 04:59.250
and new investors.

04:59.870 --> 05:00.720
But

05:03.270 --> 05:04.800
things came to an end today.

05:06.900 --> 05:09.560
No one will take over
the current Xinxin Vision.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.010
What are you going to do?

05:15.310 --> 05:16.570
I don't want to give up.

05:17.190 --> 05:19.830
I plan to personally fund
the company's operations

05:19.830 --> 05:22.160
until we develop a satisfactory product.

05:22.310 --> 05:24.110
I believe there will be a return.

05:24.360 --> 05:25.360
Personally fund?

05:27.040 --> 05:30.450
How long will your own money
sustain the company?

05:31.160 --> 05:32.159
87 days.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.360
87 days.

05:35.000 --> 05:36.270
So precise.

05:37.510 --> 05:39.110
What will happen after that?

05:39.430 --> 05:40.980
If you fail to launch any products

05:40.980 --> 05:42.140
at that time,

05:42.270 --> 05:43.360
or if you don't have cash flow or profit

05:43.360 --> 05:44.890
after launching products,

05:45.190 --> 05:46.520
what should you do then?

05:49.560 --> 05:50.680
I haven't thought that far ahead.

05:50.680 --> 05:52.540
I want to take it one step at a time.

05:54.870 --> 05:56.330
Has it ever occurred to you

05:57.510 --> 06:01.040
that the company couldn't develop
any products in three years?

06:01.270 --> 06:03.670
Can you guarantee to
develop one in 87 days?

06:09.630 --> 06:10.200
No.

06:11.680 --> 06:12.900
That means

06:13.330 --> 06:14.750
if we give up the company now,

06:14.750 --> 06:16.510
at least we can save you,

06:17.050 --> 06:17.670
right?

06:18.830 --> 06:21.070
But if you continue to invest,

06:21.970 --> 06:24.950
-it's a gamble with no chance of winning.
-No. Jingjing. Jingjing!

06:24.950 --> 06:26.390
I can't give up.

06:26.390 --> 06:28.380
This project is like my child.

06:28.400 --> 06:30.480
Saving a child is every parent's instinct.

06:30.480 --> 06:31.480
You would do the same.

06:31.480 --> 06:32.360
It's not that serious.

06:32.360 --> 06:33.960
Lu Ze, it's not that serious.

06:34.000 --> 06:35.159
Have you thought about

06:35.159 --> 06:37.190
doing something else to take a break?

06:37.190 --> 06:39.430
-We can find another chance.
-No. It's that serious.

06:39.430 --> 06:40.750
With my current mood,

06:40.750 --> 06:41.450
and Xinxin Vision

06:41.450 --> 06:42.530
at the low point,

06:42.560 --> 06:44.340
I can't do anything else.

06:44.360 --> 06:45.760
Then, let's get married.

06:49.070 --> 06:50.590
Let's get married first.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.920
We'll go on a honeymoon.

06:51.920 --> 06:53.270
You can relax.

06:53.270 --> 06:54.900
And we can ease up.

06:55.630 --> 06:57.560
After we come back, we can start over.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.060
Right? I'll be with you.

06:59.159 --> 07:01.120
-No big deal.
-Jingjing.

07:05.310 --> 07:07.240
Under the current circumstances,

07:08.190 --> 07:09.940
the wedding must be postponed.

07:20.950 --> 07:23.480
Are you going to risk it
all for Xinxin Vision,

07:24.080 --> 07:25.830
losing your entire fortune,

07:25.870 --> 07:27.470
and leaving nothing behind?

07:31.190 --> 07:33.770
Even at the cost of your future?

07:35.430 --> 07:36.150
Yes.

07:36.800 --> 07:37.600
What about me?

07:40.750 --> 07:42.080
Have you considered me?

07:58.720 --> 07:59.320
Jingjing.

08:00.240 --> 08:00.840
Jingjing.

08:02.870 --> 08:03.510
Jingjing.

08:04.390 --> 08:05.870
Jingjing, calm down.

08:05.870 --> 08:06.720
Calm down.

08:09.200 --> 08:10.610
Calm down, okay?

08:11.190 --> 08:11.800
Lu Ze.

08:14.190 --> 08:15.720
Let me ask you one more time.

08:17.190 --> 08:17.790
Well,

08:18.600 --> 08:20.840
think over it.

08:21.630 --> 08:23.560
Think over it before answering me.

08:25.100 --> 08:26.730
Let me ask you.

08:27.320 --> 08:29.980
If you have to choose
between me and the company,

08:30.960 --> 08:32.490
which one would you choose?

08:33.960 --> 08:34.940
Jingjing.

08:35.200 --> 08:37.390
Why do we have to
make this kind of choice?

08:37.390 --> 08:38.630
I want my career and the company

08:38.630 --> 08:40.549
to give you a better life.

08:40.549 --> 08:41.789
It's not for me.

08:43.200 --> 08:44.480
It's for your career.

08:44.480 --> 08:45.480
Face the truth.

08:45.480 --> 08:46.960
Don't take me as an excuse.

08:46.980 --> 08:48.870
Even without me, you would
make the same decision,

08:48.870 --> 08:49.670
wouldn't you?

08:51.440 --> 08:53.510
Have you ever considered me, Lu Ze?

08:55.840 --> 08:56.750
For me?

08:58.260 --> 08:59.950
Do you know what I want?

09:11.840 --> 09:13.370
I will ask you one last time.

09:16.270 --> 09:17.600
Which one do you choose?

10:54.360 --> 10:56.000
What exactly happened?

10:58.310 --> 11:00.950
I exposed the fake accounts
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group,

11:00.950 --> 11:02.750
which affected Lu Ze's company.

11:03.510 --> 11:05.180
I wanted to tell Jingjing,

11:05.520 --> 11:07.780
but I never gathered the courage to do so.

11:08.960 --> 11:10.750
And I don't have the money
to pay back Wang Ruohai.

11:10.750 --> 11:12.240
After all the fuss today,

11:12.720 --> 11:15.110
it turns out his mother is sick.

11:15.790 --> 11:16.960
Am I a bad person?

11:18.000 --> 11:20.360
Don't always take the blame on yourself.

11:20.720 --> 11:22.110
If it were before,

11:22.510 --> 11:24.310
I might have reflected on myself

11:24.550 --> 11:26.350
and regretted not doing better.

11:27.320 --> 11:28.910
But now I realize

11:29.030 --> 11:30.430
many things in this world

11:31.240 --> 11:34.910
can't be told as good or bad.

11:35.120 --> 11:37.350
There are many unavoidable circumstances.

11:37.350 --> 11:38.560
"Unavoidable"

11:39.000 --> 11:40.660
is just another name for life.

11:42.670 --> 11:45.150
You really are different
after going through difficulties.

11:45.150 --> 11:47.540
You can still sit here to provide
comfort after such a big scene.

11:47.540 --> 11:48.790
I'm serious.

11:50.840 --> 11:51.980
I know.

11:52.150 --> 11:52.960
At work,

11:52.960 --> 11:55.270
you definitely wouldn't
target Lu Ze on purpose.

11:55.270 --> 11:56.390
Find a proper occasion

11:56.390 --> 11:58.200
to explain it clearly to Jingjing.

11:58.200 --> 12:00.130
They will definitely understand.

12:01.240 --> 12:03.450
But as for Wang Ruohai,

12:03.800 --> 12:05.550
I'm afraid your bleeding heart
will act up again

12:05.550 --> 12:08.010
and you'll start considering his feelings.

12:08.040 --> 12:09.000
I won't.

12:09.030 --> 12:11.120
I'm not a fool who falls into
the same trap twice.

12:11.120 --> 12:11.900
Don't worry.

12:17.740 --> 12:19.360
You didn't tell me your family
was in trouble,

12:19.360 --> 12:20.930
or that you needed money.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.080
For Auntie's treatment,

12:22.080 --> 12:23.410
I could have paid for it.

12:23.570 --> 12:25.080
You made such a big fuss today

12:25.080 --> 12:26.840
over such a small thing.

12:27.340 --> 12:29.200
Don't you think it's ridiculous?

12:30.360 --> 12:33.090
This amount of money might
be a small thing to you,

12:33.600 --> 12:35.080
but not to my family.

12:35.670 --> 12:36.270
Shiyu.

12:37.360 --> 12:39.360
I just didn't want our relationship

12:39.390 --> 12:41.320
to be mixed up with other elements.

12:41.680 --> 12:43.360
So, if there's anything I can
solve on my own,

12:43.360 --> 12:44.890
I want to try my best to do it.

12:45.380 --> 12:46.840
Why draw such a clear line?

12:47.290 --> 12:48.550
Your business is mine.

12:48.710 --> 12:50.550
You said nothing
when you ran into trouble.

12:50.550 --> 12:53.090
You'd rather ask Qian Fei
for money than tell me.

12:53.090 --> 12:55.220
You didn't see me as your partner.

12:56.140 --> 12:58.100
Alright, don't be mad.

13:00.370 --> 13:02.090
How could I think so?

13:02.270 --> 13:03.600
When I'm in front of you,

13:03.720 --> 13:05.450
I feel like an outsider myself.

13:09.730 --> 13:11.000
Then from now on, when you
run into trouble,

13:11.000 --> 13:12.680
can you think of me first?

13:17.060 --> 13:17.970
Is that okay?

13:19.640 --> 13:20.230
Yes.

13:21.240 --> 13:22.280
Then, can I pay

13:22.300 --> 13:24.160
for your mother's treatment now?

13:26.150 --> 13:26.850
How about

13:27.930 --> 13:29.060
I borrow it from you?

13:29.990 --> 13:30.950
That's okay.

14:47.890 --> 14:49.410
You didn't see the scene.

14:49.480 --> 14:51.270
Qian Fei's friend brought
a large suitcase of cash

14:51.270 --> 14:53.200
and put it right on the lobby floor.

14:54.360 --> 14:55.960
Liao Shiyu is a mistress.

14:55.960 --> 14:57.480
Wang Ruohai cheated on Qian Fei

14:57.480 --> 14:58.910
and forced her to pay back the money.

14:58.910 --> 15:00.320
So, her friend stood up for her.

15:00.320 --> 15:01.060
See?

15:01.240 --> 15:03.030
I told all this as soon as

15:03.030 --> 15:04.150
I joined Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

15:04.150 --> 15:05.110
Word for word.

15:05.200 --> 15:06.830
I didn't expect Liao Shiyu
to really be the mistress.

15:06.830 --> 15:09.290
-Qian Fei.
-Liao Shi Yu is really a mistress.

15:10.670 --> 15:12.400
Director Fang wants to see you.

15:13.810 --> 15:18.530
[Office Area]

15:24.360 --> 15:25.180
Why didn't you say so earlier?

15:25.180 --> 15:26.000
Did you do it on purpose?

15:26.000 --> 15:26.870
I just saw her.

15:39.790 --> 15:41.320
You did a good job today,

15:42.870 --> 15:45.400
letting everyone watch
a great show for free.

15:46.240 --> 15:47.120
I didn't expect

15:47.150 --> 15:48.750
things to develop like this.

15:49.750 --> 15:51.650
I know it caused a very bad impact.

15:51.890 --> 15:52.530
I'm sorry.

15:53.150 --> 15:54.810
Saying sorry to me is useless.

15:58.790 --> 16:02.030
I don't care if you knew
about it beforehand.

16:02.720 --> 16:04.330
You caused this farce.

16:04.550 --> 16:06.210
The responsibility is yours.

16:06.790 --> 16:09.030
I have no intention of interfering
with your private life.

16:09.030 --> 16:11.140
But this is Shan Li Fang Group.

16:11.270 --> 16:12.390
It is the client you serve

16:12.390 --> 16:13.360
and the place where you work.

16:13.360 --> 16:16.200
Now you have brought your private
matters to your workplace.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.400
You know that, right?

16:22.440 --> 16:23.770
Let me be more specific.

16:24.200 --> 16:25.370
I don't want it

16:25.840 --> 16:27.840
to affect our sponsor team's work.

16:28.150 --> 16:30.410
So, please resolve it as soon as possible

16:30.760 --> 16:31.960
and quiet the gossip.

16:32.540 --> 16:34.270
and go apologize to Liao Shiyu.

16:36.000 --> 16:36.900
I won't do it.

16:37.780 --> 16:40.020
I will admit what I did wrong.

16:40.680 --> 16:41.750
But this personal matter

16:41.750 --> 16:43.830
happened at an inappropriate time.

16:44.320 --> 16:46.480
But that doesn't mean I will apologize

16:46.570 --> 16:48.600
for a personal matter
where I did nothing wrong

16:48.600 --> 16:49.720
for the sake of work.

16:49.720 --> 16:52.000
I made it very clear just now.

16:52.030 --> 16:53.370
Don't you understand?

16:54.080 --> 16:56.510
Now that you've brought
private matters to the workplace,

16:56.510 --> 16:57.760
it's a work matter.

16:57.990 --> 17:00.120
You have seriously affected our work.

17:00.720 --> 17:02.110
Wang Ruohai and I

17:02.350 --> 17:04.810
mixed up private and professional matters.

17:04.960 --> 17:06.579
I gave up my job for the sake
of our relationship.

17:06.579 --> 17:08.200
So, I will never repeat that mistake.

17:08.200 --> 17:09.280
At work,

17:09.599 --> 17:10.920
I will let my ability speak for itself.

17:10.920 --> 17:11.670
In private matters,

17:11.670 --> 17:13.200
I will solve them on principle.

17:13.200 --> 17:14.660
But I won't apologize.

17:15.099 --> 17:16.440
And I certainly won't

17:16.470 --> 17:19.329
compromise my private matters
for the sake of work.

17:23.160 --> 17:23.829
Childish.

17:38.030 --> 17:39.790
Here, it's warm.

17:40.540 --> 17:41.350
Thank you.

17:50.520 --> 17:51.120
Fei.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.030
I

17:52.030 --> 17:54.430
can't stand people like Liao Shiyu either.

17:54.750 --> 17:56.110
She just has a good father.

17:56.110 --> 17:57.460
What's the big deal?

18:02.830 --> 18:05.030
How come I didn't see Director Li today?

18:05.640 --> 18:07.240
With such a thing happening,

18:07.590 --> 18:08.640
if he doesn't come to
make some sarcastic remarks,

18:08.640 --> 18:09.680
I'm not used to it.

18:10.800 --> 18:12.450
He told me he had something to do.

18:12.450 --> 18:14.110
I don't know what he went to do.

18:16.060 --> 18:17.260
I'm getting off work.

18:18.440 --> 18:19.510
You'd go back early too.

18:19.510 --> 18:20.000
Okay.

18:27.390 --> 18:30.110
[Line 12]

19:59.070 --> 20:00.160
It's already dark.

20:07.960 --> 20:09.730
Why isn't Li Yifei back yet?

20:38.550 --> 20:41.790
I'm counting on you all for this.

20:41.920 --> 20:44.460
This happened so suddenly today.

20:44.640 --> 20:46.920
I'm just afraid someone
will fan the flames

20:46.920 --> 20:48.160
and blow things out of proportion.

20:48.160 --> 20:51.450
So, we need to take precautions
on the social media front.

20:51.590 --> 20:52.320
Don't worry.

20:53.350 --> 20:54.100
Please.

20:55.070 --> 20:55.890
Please.

20:55.920 --> 20:57.030
I'll do my best.

20:57.030 --> 20:57.920
-Bye.
-Take care. Bye.

20:57.920 --> 20:58.400
-Bye.
-Bye.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.400
Take care, Mr. Li.

21:01.030 --> 21:03.710
You're nowhere to be found
when I need you.

21:04.640 --> 21:05.850
When there's nothing going on,

21:05.850 --> 21:07.640
you just wander around
in front of me every day.

21:07.640 --> 21:08.780
You are so annoying.

21:26.590 --> 21:28.110
Are you okay?

21:42.510 --> 21:44.150
Please.

21:48.200 --> 21:49.030
They left?

21:49.640 --> 21:50.700
They're all gone.

21:52.030 --> 21:54.160
-Slow down.
-I've drunk a lot tonight.

21:54.920 --> 21:57.650
Those two have such a high tolerance
for alcohol.

21:58.960 --> 21:59.980
Thank you.

22:00.700 --> 22:03.010
When Fulaxida starts making money,

22:03.210 --> 22:04.160
you can make a list,

22:04.160 --> 22:06.320
and I'll buy all the things on it for you.

22:06.320 --> 22:09.640
I'm already at the peak of

22:09.670 --> 22:11.330
Maslow's hierarchy of needs.

22:11.350 --> 22:13.140
I just need a word from you.

22:13.830 --> 22:15.900
You helped your landlady a lot.

22:16.640 --> 22:18.010
Are you really into her?

22:25.480 --> 22:27.520
What about Jinzi,

22:27.550 --> 22:29.010
whom Qi introduced to you?

22:31.750 --> 22:33.120
What do you mean?

22:33.690 --> 22:34.960
We just hung out together

22:34.960 --> 22:36.520
and had some drinks.

22:36.640 --> 22:38.530
What is there to deal with?

22:39.830 --> 22:42.690
Jinzi is so pretty, but you didn't
even fall for her.

22:42.750 --> 22:45.770
You're dead set on sucking up
to the landlady, right?

22:46.380 --> 22:48.840
Then, why don't you pursue
the pretty Jinzi?

22:54.080 --> 22:55.920
I finally figured it out.

22:56.070 --> 22:57.730
How does that saying go again?

22:58.550 --> 23:00.980
What goes around

23:01.240 --> 23:04.440
comes around.

23:05.030 --> 23:07.100
Li Yifei,

23:07.270 --> 23:09.420
you used to be a big shot.

23:09.450 --> 23:13.050
I can't believe you've fallen into the
tragedy of a secret crush.

23:14.160 --> 23:16.350
Seeing you like this in my lifetime,

23:16.790 --> 23:17.480
I have no regret.

23:17.480 --> 23:19.250
Damn tragedy!

23:19.750 --> 23:22.270
This is an open and honest secret crush.

23:23.200 --> 23:24.240
Wait and see.

23:24.350 --> 23:26.010
I'll make it public very soon.

23:26.240 --> 23:27.030
I'm done talking to you.

23:27.030 --> 23:28.030
I'm heading back.

23:29.000 --> 23:30.250
Wait, wait, wait.

23:31.610 --> 23:32.890
I'll wait and see.

23:33.690 --> 23:34.620
Where is the car?

24:04.720 --> 24:05.720
Qian Fei.

24:06.480 --> 24:08.880
I didn't want to put so much
pressure on you.

24:09.010 --> 24:10.410
My mom fell ill suddenly.

24:10.950 --> 24:12.970
Their savings were all tied
up in the house.

24:12.970 --> 24:14.570
And I have no savings either.

24:14.920 --> 24:17.120
I really had no other choice at the time.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.960
I hope you can understand.

24:21.850 --> 24:23.950
[Qian Fei]

24:40.770 --> 24:42.090
I'm back.

24:50.040 --> 24:51.100
I'm back.

24:57.090 --> 24:57.560
I...

25:08.100 --> 25:08.980
Look at you.

25:09.830 --> 25:11.110
You are a grown-up,

25:11.650 --> 25:13.260
but you don't even know
how to cover yourself properly.

25:13.260 --> 25:15.500
Such a big bed is not enough for you.

25:20.640 --> 25:21.160
Come on.

25:22.160 --> 25:23.620
Let your master cover you.

25:42.720 --> 25:43.860
Boring.

25:45.200 --> 25:46.200
Boring.

25:46.240 --> 25:48.710
Cover up. Don't catch a cold.

25:56.590 --> 25:58.510
Why are you pouting in your sleep?

26:03.500 --> 26:05.580
♪ I really miss you ♪

26:06.170 --> 26:07.290
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

26:07.910 --> 26:10.790
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

26:11.280 --> 26:12.530
♪ I love you so much ♪

26:13.470 --> 26:16.010
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

26:16.730 --> 26:19.680
♪ Living in my heart ♪

26:21.410 --> 26:24.800
♪ The stars see through
the tenderness of the night ♪

26:24.680 --> 26:25.420
Landlady.

26:25.510 --> 26:28.290
♪ Lighten the streets of the city ♪

26:26.480 --> 26:27.580
Sleeping like this

26:28.740 --> 26:32.300
♪ The night breeze blows through
every window ♪

26:32.550 --> 26:35.730
♪ Watching the two's
little universe secretly ♪

26:33.320 --> 26:35.420
Let me see what you're reading.

26:36.140 --> 26:39.410
♪ Meeting will flirt with lazy waiting ♪

26:37.830 --> 26:38.910
Not bad

26:40.040 --> 26:43.010
♪ Love lights the fireworks ♪

26:40.200 --> 26:41.400
You've made progress

26:43.490 --> 26:46.620
♪ I fell in love with you
without permission ♪

26:47.300 --> 26:50.910
♪ I began to doodle on
this romantic cabin ♪

26:52.640 --> 26:54.590
♪ I really miss you ♪

26:55.200 --> 26:56.870
Good for you

26:55.500 --> 26:56.340
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

26:57.070 --> 26:59.800
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

26:57.160 --> 26:59.040
You even copied my book list.

27:00.620 --> 27:01.710
♪ I love you so much ♪

27:02.030 --> 27:02.680
Okay

27:02.430 --> 27:05.290
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

27:04.790 --> 27:05.920
Who is this?

27:07.640 --> 27:12.020
♪ Living in my heart ♪

27:13.990 --> 27:15.820
Why does it look a bit like me?

27:15.850 --> 27:17.580
The more I see this little bear,

27:20.750 --> 27:22.000
the more it looks like me.

27:22.000 --> 27:23.860
All right, let's sleep together.

27:25.920 --> 27:27.200
Don't catch a cold.

27:27.640 --> 27:30.380
♪ The sweetness of ice cream
mixed with the saltiness of tears ♪

27:30.830 --> 27:33.960
♪ I've tucked all my words
into viral quotes ♪

27:31.000 --> 27:32.160
Oh my god.

27:34.440 --> 27:37.590
♪ I look up at the bright moon,
and you lean down to kiss me ♪

27:34.480 --> 27:35.920
My landlady,

27:36.030 --> 27:37.860
you are lucky that

27:38.000 --> 27:39.720
you can have a tenant like me.

27:38.000 --> 27:40.660
♪ Like spring soil nourishing flowers,
I'll protect you ♪

27:40.030 --> 27:41.360
Don't say anything else

27:41.370 --> 27:44.780
♪ You're the joy of my youth.
You're the boy I love ♪

27:42.270 --> 27:43.960
your aesthetic taste

27:44.200 --> 27:45.960
has gradually improved.

27:45.520 --> 27:47.930
♪ The moonlight shines on the river,
and I chase after you ♪

27:47.270 --> 27:48.580
And you even

27:48.490 --> 27:52.370
♪ My posts you praised make me glad ♪

27:48.610 --> 27:50.310
bought a bear as handsome as me.

27:50.310 --> 27:51.510
Did you notice that?

27:53.440 --> 27:55.870
♪ Cranes return to the lonely mountain,
and I belong to you ♪

27:54.060 --> 27:55.580
Incredible.

27:55.920 --> 27:59.100
You show great promise.

27:58.070 --> 28:00.020
♪ I really miss you ♪

28:00.530 --> 28:01.820
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

28:01.000 --> 28:02.760
You can be taught

28:02.320 --> 28:05.260
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

28:05.480 --> 28:06.730
I'm going to sleep.

28:06.040 --> 28:07.130
♪ I love you so much ♪

28:07.780 --> 28:10.630
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

28:13.260 --> 28:18.670
♪ Living in my heart ♪

28:13.640 --> 28:14.740
Good night.

28:22.690 --> 28:23.380
Landlady.

28:24.170 --> 28:24.890
Landlady! Landlady!

28:24.890 --> 28:26.090
Emergency! Emergency!

28:26.090 --> 28:26.760
What is it?

28:27.270 --> 28:28.640
Help me!

28:30.130 --> 28:31.340
Well...

28:31.600 --> 28:33.000
The dry cleaner absolutely
refused to expedite it for me.

28:33.000 --> 28:34.690
I need to wear this to a business
meeting this afternoon.

28:34.690 --> 28:36.000
Could you do me a favor?

28:36.000 --> 28:38.600
Do you really think of me
as your maid, Li Yifei?

28:39.640 --> 28:41.170
What are you talking about?

28:43.310 --> 28:45.040
Who are you calling an old maid?

28:47.160 --> 28:48.320
Why do you make our relationship

28:48.320 --> 28:49.580
sound so utilitarian?

28:50.450 --> 28:53.490
-Don't we have true feelings?
-Stop. Stop.

28:53.830 --> 28:55.880
I don't know you well. Don't touch me.

28:55.880 --> 28:57.260
You don't know me well?

28:59.670 --> 29:00.980
You don't know me well?

29:01.800 --> 29:02.680
Don't you want to know

29:02.680 --> 29:04.880
what books I've been reading recently?

29:06.400 --> 29:07.400
I... You...

29:11.110 --> 29:12.390
Why would

29:12.410 --> 29:13.720
I want to know that?

29:13.820 --> 29:15.340
Yeah. I want to ask you too.

29:16.460 --> 29:17.620
If you don't want to know,

29:17.620 --> 29:18.710
why are the books you borrowed

29:18.710 --> 29:21.470
exactly the same as the ones I bought?

29:23.100 --> 29:25.760
Don't tell me it's a coincidence.
I don't buy it.

29:25.770 --> 29:27.940
All coincidences in this world

29:28.240 --> 29:29.280
are intentional.

29:31.790 --> 29:33.030
Speechless, right?

29:34.220 --> 29:35.160
With me living here,

29:35.160 --> 29:37.900
you benefit a lot.

29:38.470 --> 29:40.470
Are you peeping at me, Li Yifei?

29:41.040 --> 29:41.750
Unbelievable.

29:41.750 --> 29:42.310
I knew

29:42.330 --> 29:43.250
living with someone like you

29:43.250 --> 29:44.230
would lead to no good.

29:44.230 --> 29:45.000
Move out right away.

29:45.000 --> 29:45.830
No, stop.

29:46.270 --> 29:47.290
Stop, stop.

29:47.750 --> 29:49.130
Don't slander me.

29:49.200 --> 29:50.400
You read books

29:50.400 --> 29:51.790
in the living room every day.

29:51.790 --> 29:52.780
It's hard for me not to know

29:52.780 --> 29:55.240
what you're reading
as I walk back and forth.

30:00.400 --> 30:01.830
But then again,

30:02.720 --> 30:04.780
I got some good books recently.

30:04.880 --> 30:06.080
They're really good.

30:06.540 --> 30:09.100
Some of them are about
institutional investment.

30:09.100 --> 30:11.940
They're enlightening and eye-opening.

30:12.170 --> 30:13.140
What are the titles?

30:13.140 --> 30:14.700
Wait. The names are...

30:15.070 --> 30:16.420
The book title...

30:17.000 --> 30:18.970
Why did my mind go blank on the titles?

30:18.970 --> 30:19.770
The titles...

30:19.970 --> 30:21.130
Titles...

30:21.160 --> 30:22.690
Don't rush me. Let me think.

30:23.000 --> 30:24.080
Titles...

30:24.600 --> 30:27.440
Titles...

30:28.160 --> 30:29.640
The titles are...

30:30.270 --> 30:32.600
I'll do your laundry, okay?

30:32.790 --> 30:33.660
If I wash these clothes,

30:33.660 --> 30:34.920
you tell me the titles.

30:36.480 --> 30:37.230
Of course.

30:37.400 --> 30:38.400
It's a fair trade.

30:38.510 --> 30:39.230
How is it fair?

30:39.230 --> 30:40.690
I'm obviously doing more.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.500
How about this?

30:42.820 --> 30:43.950
I wash your clothes.

30:44.210 --> 30:46.100
Then you tell me the titles.

30:46.500 --> 30:48.040
And in addition,

30:48.260 --> 30:49.680
you must go down
and buy food right now.

30:49.680 --> 30:50.680
No.

30:51.090 --> 30:52.130
No.

30:53.190 --> 30:56.320
You could have finished the laundry
before buying food.

30:56.530 --> 30:57.420
Laundry or groceries,

30:57.420 --> 30:58.180
pick one.

30:58.210 --> 30:59.330
Otherwise, I quit.

30:59.820 --> 31:02.750
Li Yifei, don't act like such
a spoiled young master.

31:03.320 --> 31:05.320
I'll read books on my own.

31:05.350 --> 31:07.160
Your recommendations might
not even be good.

31:07.160 --> 31:08.000
Don't.

31:08.640 --> 31:10.250
Fine, I'll go.

31:10.280 --> 31:11.480
Sit. I'll go.

31:12.300 --> 31:14.250
But you'd know you're so lucky today.

31:14.250 --> 31:16.660
I've never bought groceries
for anyone in my life.

31:16.660 --> 31:18.310
If my grandfather finds out

31:18.330 --> 31:19.990
that I gave my first time to you

31:20.150 --> 31:21.280
instead of him,

31:21.680 --> 31:23.680
he'll probably have a heart attack.

31:24.360 --> 31:25.510
Li Yifei,

31:27.200 --> 31:28.570
you are so annoying.

31:28.760 --> 31:30.420
It's just running an errand
to buy groceries.

31:30.420 --> 31:32.170
Do you have to put yourself
on such a pedestal?

31:32.170 --> 31:33.020
I didn't.

31:33.320 --> 31:34.830
You even brought your old man into this.

31:34.830 --> 31:36.600
I didn't. It's the truth.

31:36.960 --> 31:38.890
And I'm just making you appreciate

31:38.910 --> 31:40.490
the chance to have me
buy groceries for you.

31:40.490 --> 31:41.820
Stop talking nonsense.

31:41.930 --> 31:43.580
You eat the food I cook every day

31:43.580 --> 31:44.820
and wear the clothes I wash.

31:44.820 --> 31:45.690
Now you still

31:45.720 --> 31:47.870
boss me around like a donkey.

31:48.720 --> 31:50.580
If my mom is watching from heaven,

31:50.600 --> 31:51.750
she'd be heartbroken.

31:51.750 --> 31:52.850
Wait and see.

31:53.140 --> 31:55.070
She'll come to talk to you at night.

32:01.750 --> 32:02.750
What a good actor.

32:11.850 --> 32:14.280
Auntie, you'd better see clearly

32:14.300 --> 32:15.900
who's bullying the weak one.

32:16.830 --> 32:18.290
You have to stand up for me.

32:18.350 --> 32:19.530
I didn't bully her.

32:21.110 --> 32:22.680
Okay, everything's fine.

32:22.960 --> 32:25.020
Alright, I'm going to buy groceries.

32:27.110 --> 32:27.840
Thank you.

32:36.510 --> 32:38.240
Landlady, you've worked hard.

32:51.550 --> 32:53.410
Another knockoff designer item.

32:53.580 --> 32:54.520
Hopeless.

33:06.910 --> 33:10.200
The clothes are washed,
but he's not back yet.

33:10.480 --> 33:13.120
Is the idiot growing
vegetables right now?

33:33.330 --> 33:35.230
Why did the color of this button

33:35.720 --> 33:37.100
get darker?

33:41.240 --> 33:42.240
I'm back.

33:44.240 --> 33:45.350
Look,

33:45.680 --> 33:47.270
a full load.

33:49.260 --> 33:50.490
I'm exhausted.

33:51.110 --> 33:52.150
Li Yifei,

33:52.820 --> 33:54.450
you didn't go to the market?

33:54.610 --> 33:56.070
You went to the imported goods
supermarket to buy food?

33:56.070 --> 33:57.800
Do you know how expensive it is?

33:59.330 --> 33:59.930
Forget it.

33:59.950 --> 34:01.210
Someone with a low IQ like you

34:01.210 --> 34:03.410
wouldn't understand, even if I told you.

34:03.410 --> 34:05.240
The imported goods supermarket
is not good?

34:05.240 --> 34:07.010
You have no idea that the self-checkout

34:07.010 --> 34:08.280
had a long line.

34:08.469 --> 34:10.320
My heels went numb from standing.

34:10.320 --> 34:12.050
And you still say it's not good.

34:14.110 --> 34:15.909
You finished washing up so fast?

34:20.100 --> 34:21.100
How was it so fast?

34:21.830 --> 34:22.520
Yeah.

34:23.050 --> 34:24.380
What are you looking at?

34:31.840 --> 34:32.590
No.

34:34.920 --> 34:36.560
Qian Fei, are you crazy?

34:36.880 --> 34:37.550
You...

34:38.070 --> 34:38.739
You...

34:38.969 --> 34:39.639
You...

34:39.670 --> 34:42.210
threw it right into the washing machine?

34:45.190 --> 34:46.989
Look at the buttons.

34:47.060 --> 34:48.429
They're all dull now.

34:48.670 --> 34:51.110
How could you just wash it like this?

34:51.620 --> 34:52.429
How else?

34:52.449 --> 34:54.320
If not the washing machine, by hand?

34:54.320 --> 34:55.900
How else?

34:56.800 --> 34:58.550
I need to calm down.

34:59.920 --> 35:00.580
No.

35:05.570 --> 35:06.930
No, here's the thing.

35:06.960 --> 35:08.430
To wash clothes like this,

35:08.690 --> 35:09.730
you should

35:09.760 --> 35:11.630
take the buttons off first.

35:12.200 --> 35:13.420
Then, you should sew the buttons back on

35:13.420 --> 35:14.680
after the shirt is dry.

35:15.230 --> 35:17.030
Otherwise, the detergent
and the washing machine

35:17.030 --> 35:18.830
will damage the buttons.

35:18.990 --> 35:20.100
Being so pretentious every day,

35:20.100 --> 35:21.140
aren't you tired?

35:27.370 --> 35:28.540
Alright, stop.

35:28.630 --> 35:30.290
And you don't need
to look at me like that.

35:30.290 --> 35:31.280
I will buy an identical on

35:31.280 --> 35:32.530
online

35:32.550 --> 35:33.610
to compensate you.

35:34.050 --> 35:35.450
Buy one?

35:35.850 --> 35:36.790
Buy one for me?

35:36.840 --> 35:37.810
Buy one for me?

35:39.400 --> 35:41.130
Hold on. Let me tell you,

35:41.190 --> 35:43.190
you're the only person in the world

35:43.190 --> 35:45.050
who can make me laugh out of anger.

35:46.440 --> 35:47.290
Thank you.

35:57.070 --> 35:57.630
Oh, no.

35:59.440 --> 36:00.610
Oh, no, no, no.

36:01.110 --> 36:02.640
Not a single one was spared.

36:03.800 --> 36:05.030
You could have left me at least one.

36:05.030 --> 36:07.160
How did they all get ruined in the wash?

36:41.570 --> 36:44.710
[Jingjing]

36:49.490 --> 36:52.020
Little thing, you think
I can't deal with you?

37:00.550 --> 37:01.350
Little thing.

37:05.510 --> 37:06.530
Close enough.

37:07.040 --> 37:08.430
Not bad.

37:09.000 --> 37:10.460
Li Yifei, you're the best.

37:16.070 --> 37:17.430
Little thing.

37:17.670 --> 37:19.500
You think I can't deal with you?

37:21.120 --> 37:22.400
Who do you think you are?

37:22.400 --> 37:24.180
What are you doing? Time to eat.

37:24.550 --> 37:25.280
Time to eat.

37:27.840 --> 37:29.770
You eat first. I'll be right there.

37:32.910 --> 37:34.740
What are you doing?
Why are you acting so sneaky?

37:34.740 --> 37:35.810
What bad things are you doing?

37:35.810 --> 37:37.290
I'm looking at the sun.

37:37.480 --> 37:39.190
The weather is so good today.

37:39.280 --> 37:40.410
The sun is so bright.

37:40.700 --> 37:41.630
It feels so good.

37:45.900 --> 37:47.930
Am I seeing this right?
You are sewing buttons?

37:47.930 --> 37:48.360
Shoo.

37:48.400 --> 37:50.000
You can do things yourself?

37:50.440 --> 37:51.790
I might prick you later.

37:53.100 --> 37:54.830
What are you doing? It's a mess.

37:56.370 --> 37:57.350
I just want to move

37:57.350 --> 37:58.480
the buttons

37:58.500 --> 38:00.490
to that ruined shirt.

38:01.370 --> 38:03.290
Bro, be reasonable, okay?

38:03.520 --> 38:05.330
Look at it yourself. Does it look good?

38:05.330 --> 38:06.210
Just give up.

38:07.590 --> 38:08.340
Stop sewing.

38:08.760 --> 38:10.290
But I don't know how to do it.

38:16.320 --> 38:17.770
You are a bit weird.

38:18.200 --> 38:19.330
Something's wrong.

38:20.010 --> 38:22.010
Why didn't you ask me to do it for you?

38:26.270 --> 38:27.520
Are you afraid that I

38:27.550 --> 38:30.120
would keep bringing
up this fake shirt thing

38:30.630 --> 38:31.960
and hurt your feelings?

38:33.280 --> 38:34.230
Of course not.

38:36.480 --> 38:37.670
I'm afraid that after dinner,

38:37.670 --> 38:39.760
you'll make me wash
the dishes in exchange.

38:39.760 --> 38:40.750
Such awareness.

38:40.960 --> 38:42.110
Let's do that.

38:42.450 --> 38:43.440
You can answer before I ask.

38:43.440 --> 38:44.500
Not bad. Come here.

38:44.670 --> 38:45.480
Stop sewing.

38:46.780 --> 38:48.820
Later, after we finish eating,

38:49.090 --> 38:50.150
I'll sew it for you.

38:50.610 --> 38:51.250
Really?

38:51.280 --> 38:52.110
Really.

38:52.280 --> 38:54.020
Then, you can't go back on your word.

38:54.020 --> 38:54.730
You said it.

38:54.760 --> 38:56.610
In exchange for washing the dishes.

38:56.610 --> 38:57.860
If you keep messing with it,

38:57.860 --> 39:00.220
you'll have washed your clothes
for nothing.

39:00.220 --> 39:01.070
Anyway,

39:01.100 --> 39:02.970
I will never wash bowls in my life.

39:07.320 --> 39:08.730
Your cooking is really good.

39:08.730 --> 39:09.590
So satisfying.

39:09.800 --> 39:11.080
Save these for tonight.

39:11.080 --> 39:12.400
I'll eat them after my meeting.

39:12.400 --> 39:14.400
Okay, I'll watch you eat them all.

39:16.150 --> 39:16.840
Right.

39:17.550 --> 39:19.010
I was just about to ask you.

39:19.650 --> 39:21.760
There was such a wonderful performance
in the lobby of Shan Li Fang yesterday.

39:21.760 --> 39:23.890
Why don't you have any reaction today?

39:24.210 --> 39:25.380
I was just about to ask you.

39:25.380 --> 39:26.840
Such a big thing happened.

39:27.510 --> 39:28.970
You didn't mention a word.

39:29.370 --> 39:30.650
If it were the usual you,

39:30.650 --> 39:32.510
you would have nagged me to death.

39:34.140 --> 39:35.430
What are you laughing at?

39:35.430 --> 39:36.160
Nothing.

39:39.180 --> 39:40.100
I just

39:41.100 --> 39:42.290
thought that

39:42.320 --> 39:45.050
at such a wonderful performance yesterday,

39:45.200 --> 39:46.670
your entrance was so amazing.

39:46.670 --> 39:49.240
That's what you should be like.

39:49.360 --> 39:49.920
Right?

39:50.760 --> 39:51.850
I knew it.

39:52.170 --> 39:54.140
You just want to see me
make a fool of myself, right?

39:54.140 --> 39:55.130
I didn't say that.

39:55.130 --> 39:56.040
You guessed it yourself.

39:56.040 --> 39:57.030
Does it even need guessing?

39:57.030 --> 39:58.200
I can tell by looking at your face.

39:58.200 --> 39:59.260
Go wash the dishes.

40:01.400 --> 40:03.670
I'd rather sew buttons
than wash the dishes.

40:03.670 --> 40:04.640
Then, let me tell you.

40:04.640 --> 40:05.920
If you don't wash the dishes today,

40:05.920 --> 40:07.450
believe it or not, I'll sew
all the buttons of your clothes

40:07.450 --> 40:08.970
onto that fake shirt.

40:09.000 --> 40:10.330
Let me tell you too.

40:10.590 --> 40:11.430
I've already

40:11.460 --> 40:12.620
contributed my first time
buying groceries today.

40:12.620 --> 40:13.530
You still want me to wash the dishes?

40:13.530 --> 40:14.450
Impossible.

40:23.400 --> 40:25.370
Qian Fei, you are so ruthless.

40:25.920 --> 40:27.370
How does the saying go?

40:27.440 --> 40:28.550
A woman's heart is the cruelest of all.

40:28.550 --> 40:29.670
Cut the crap.

40:30.070 --> 40:32.130
You've been freeloading for so long.

40:32.370 --> 40:34.260
It's time to contribute your labor.

40:34.260 --> 40:35.920
Let me tell you, in my entire life,

40:35.920 --> 40:37.070
this is really my first time
washing dishes.

40:37.070 --> 40:38.190
I've never washed dishes before.

40:38.190 --> 40:39.960
I really don't know how to wash them.

40:39.960 --> 40:41.070
If you eat the soap suds I leave behind,

40:41.070 --> 40:42.840
you'll get a stomachache.

41:02.220 --> 41:04.280
My mom used to sew for me like this too.

41:04.470 --> 41:06.000
My mom taught me how to do it.

41:11.960 --> 41:12.710
Done.

41:15.840 --> 41:16.900
Take it and wear it.

41:16.920 --> 41:17.960
Remember to pay.

42:37.690 --> 42:38.330
Mr. Lu.

42:38.880 --> 42:41.140
Is the boss of Qiansheng Group reliable?

42:42.600 --> 42:43.840
The introducer said

42:43.870 --> 42:45.600
this boss is very open-minded.

42:45.800 --> 42:47.930
And it's a well-established company.

42:49.400 --> 42:51.260
Let's treat it as our last gamble.

42:52.150 --> 42:53.770
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:53.920 --> 42:56.180
Lu Ze is just an entrepreneurial maniac.

42:56.530 --> 42:58.710
I can risk everything for a poor guy.

42:58.710 --> 43:00.120
No problem.

43:00.400 --> 43:01.930
Then, do you still love him?

43:03.360 --> 43:04.890
I tossed my former pride

43:04.910 --> 43:07.190
into the wet market and the kitchen sink.

43:07.860 --> 43:09.590
Doesn't that count as a change?

43:10.250 --> 43:11.450
I must learn from you.

43:12.110 --> 43:12.710
Change.

43:12.950 --> 43:13.620
Change!

43:13.640 --> 43:14.190
Change!

43:14.210 --> 43:14.940
Change.

43:15.670 --> 43:16.570
What should we do?

43:16.570 --> 43:18.570
We couldn't keep that matter quiet.

43:18.610 --> 43:19.460
I see.

43:19.710 --> 43:22.510
Someone must be causing trouble
behind our backs.

43:22.540 --> 43:23.420
I'll find a solution.
